sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Stitch / ViewModel
    participant Backend as NavigationBackend actor
    participant Data as LocalNavigationRepository / Room
    participant Plan as RoutePlanner / A*
    participant Trip as NavigationSession
    participant Store as RoomSessionStore
    User->>UI: Search and choose destination
    UI->>Backend: search(query, region)
    Backend->>Data: Local search and destination capabilities
    Data-->>Backend: Places / entrance readiness
    Backend-->>UI: Generation-checked search state
    UI->>Backend: plan(request)
    Backend->>Plan: Resolve active graph and endpoints
    Plan-->>Backend: Ready route or typed unavailable
    Backend->>Trip: Preview if valid
    Backend-->>UI: State update
    User->>UI: Start
    UI->>Backend: start()
    Backend->>Trip: Require fresh accurate fix near start
    Trip-->>Backend: Accepted session or recovery reason
    Backend->>Store: Atomic trip and checkpoint write
    loop Foreground location and ticks
        UI->>Backend: location(fix) / tick()
        Backend->>Trip: Process quality and progress
        Trip-->>Backend: Snapshot / speech / optional reroute request
        Backend-->>UI: Immutable state
    end
    alt Repeated deviation
        Backend->>Plan: Plan replacement against pinned version
        Plan-->>Backend: Replacement result
        Backend->>Trip: Validate matching session / request and current fix
    else Arrival or stop
        Backend->>Store: Final summary and checkpoint removal
    end
